    "updated_at": "2019-05-11T14:39:56Z",
    "body": "For context, the purpose of this PR is to write out how the [Atomics.waitAsync](https://github.com/tc39/proposal-atomics-wait-async) proposal could use HTML to schedule the resolution of a Promise. That proposal is currently at Stage 2; this PR shouldn't land until Atomics.waitAsync reaches Stage 3 (at which point we will have more information about implementer interest).",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
