    "created_at": "2019-05-14T12:48:24Z",
    "updated_at": "2019-05-14T12:48:24Z",
    "body": "> I guess there's a question if the host needs to be involved in the initial transfer of promiseCapibility across the agent boundary, but probably that's fine for now.\r\n\r\nThe promiseCapability is never *inspected* across agents; it's just put in a Record that's on a [cross-agent list](https://tc39.github.io/ecma262/#sec-getwaiterlist), and then pulled out of that and passed back to the original agent. Where do you think the host should be involved?",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "reactions": {
      "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/whatwg/html/issues/comments/492222861/reactions",
      "total_count": 0,
