    "created_at": "2023-05-05T00:31:47Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-05-05T00:31:47Z",
    "body": "Rebased with two host hooks following the latest [pending-Stage-4 PR](https://github.com/tc39/ecma262/pull/3049).\r\n\r\n- HostEnqueueCrossAgentJob that enqueues a job in another agent, used for explicitly notified cross-agent `Atomics.waitAsync` promises.\r\n- HostEnqueueTimeoutJob that enqueues a job in the same agent after a timeout, used for `Atomics.waitAsync` promises with timeouts.",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
